{offset100}{ia8}{arial}



{offset205}{arialbld}Tyron Spirex{arial}

Imperial Palace of Fanazaki{offset0}







It seems you had an unexpected encounter at Kaïtan.


She's known as Mayumi Bazuka.
It's a false identity, in reality she's the Princess Mayumi Tagamoshi, daughter of the emperor!{pause}

Tagamoshi only had one daughter by the empress Sashiko, did you know? The empress did not survive her first childbirth. The inconsolable emperor refused to remarry and saw to his little daughter Mayumi's education himself.{pause} 

{ia9}{offset105}She grew up to be a tomboy with a brazen personality. Since childhood she showed an instant passion for "things which fly". This started with kites, then later with fighter aircraft. The hangars close to the Imperial Air Force became her favorite playgrounds. She learned mechanics herself, at 14 she already knew everything about a 12 cylinder radial engine on the Zenzen super fighter.{pause}





{offset0}By 17, no-one was capable of dissuading her from becoming a pilot. The emperor, worn after years of his young daughter's stubornness, finally gave into this ultimate caprice...

And so began the career of Mayumi "Bazuka", now at 21 years of age, reputed to be the ace of the aces of the Nikonese air force.



Despite all of her father's prohibitions, she intervened at Kaïtan. Her success emboldened her, now she has given herself the idea of joining us for phase B of Operation TSUNAMI.

By request of the emperor I will personally see to it that this little brat return to the palace under guard.

Crossing the Karal Sea to land on Katzarin is not an operation for girlies. The Parano bases of {arialbld}Vladivostok{arial} and {arialbld}Madagan{arial} possess gigantic coastal batteries of 600 mm with 25km range.{pause}












{center}{device42}











{pause}Luckily the TSUNAMI plan takes this detail into account.

A new application of rocket technology has just arrived. Our Kormoran navy fighters can henceforth receive 8 AIR-GROUND rockets. This ammunition will be essential for taking out these batteries.




{offset150}{arialbld}Tyron Spirex{arial}

Grand Maestro for the Ingenious TSUNAMI Plan


